<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-LOKOMOTIV MOSCOW WIN RUSSIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LOKOMOTIV MOSCOW WIN RUSSIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lokomotiv Moscow beat Dynamo Moscow 2-0 (half-time 1-0) in Wednesday's final to win the Russian Cup.</p>
<p>Scorers - Alexander Smirnov 25, Yevgeny Kharlachev 78</p>
